<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">stillwater-lake-chowder</ansi> (cooking recipe)

A steaming wooden bowl of pale chowder, thick with freshwater
clams, soft cubes of root vegetable, and a few green flecks of
lake-mint floating on the surface. The first spoonful drives the
chill out of the bones; the second puts it back into your
shoulders for whatever comes next.

